<title>USA: Cyclone tracks past Fiji - WSC.</title>
<headline>Cyclone tracks past Fiji - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical cyclone Gavin tracked just west of Nandi in the Fiji islands in the past 12 hours, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Friday.</p>
<p>The area reported very heavy rains and strong winds and a storm surge of 15-25 feet may have affected the north coasts as the system tracked by, WSC said.</p>
